"3" value="67"/><column index="4" value="65"/></column_widths><filter_values/><conditional_formats/><row_id_formats/><display_formats/><hidden_columns/><plot_y_axes/><global_filter/></table></browse_table_settings></tab_browse><tab_sql><sql name="SQL 1"># &quot;https://www.pornpics.com/galleries/aria-valencia-maria-kazi-have-a-threesome-in-halloween-outfits-88969750/&quot;



SELECT pictures.*

FROM pictures

JOIN pictures_galleries ON pictures.id = pictures_galleries.pictureId

JOIN galleries ON pictures_galleries.galleryId = galleries.id

WHERE galleries.url = &quot;https://www.pornpics.com/galleries/aria-valencia-maria-kazi-have-a-threesome-in-halloween-outfits-88969750/&quot;;



SELECT * from pictures where url = &quot;https://cdni.pornpics.com/1280/7/694/42896832/42896832_005_2336.jpg&quot;





SELECT * from pictures where id = 5188



SELECT * from pictures_galleries where pictureId = 5188

SELECT * from pictures_galleries where galleryId = 9273



-- 9273

SELECT * from galleries where url = &quot;https://www.pornpics.com/galleries/glamorous-lupe-fuentes-doffs-her-sexy-yellow-dress-to-go-naked-in-public-71229326/&quot;



SELECT * from galleries where id = 9273</sql><current_tab id="0"/></tab_sql></sqlb_project>
